; energy_size_mismatch: ENERGY over a model and a sample of different sizes
; raises SizeMismatch.
;
; spec/xqvm/ISA.md's ENERGY row requires the sizes to match, and
; spec/xqvm/SPEC.md's Faults table names the identity: SizeMismatch is
; raised when ENERGY's model and sample have different sizes.

PUSH 3
BQMX r0          ; model of size 3
PUSH 4
BSMX r1          ; sample of size 4
ENERGY r0 r1
HALT
